<h1>ChemPoint Professional</h1>
<h2>Advanced Environmental Data Management for Microsoft Access and SQL Server</h2>

<p>
	<a href="http://pointstar.com/StarpointHelp/ChemPointPro/ChemPointProHelp.html" target="_blank">Browse the help system to learn more.</a>
</p>
<h3>
	Database Support Includes:
</h3>
<ul>
	<li>Microsoft Access 2003 or later</li>
	<li>Microsoft SQL Server</li>
	<li>Microsoft SQL Server Express (free version)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Version 7.1</h3>

<ul>
	<li>Improved Performance</li>
	<li>Improved Support for Windows 10 and 11</li>
	<li>Improved Support for Microsoft SQL Server Express</li>
</ul>




<p>
	<b>
		ChemPoint Professional
		Edition
	</b> is our enhanced version of
	the popular ChemPoint environmental data management system.&nbsp; In
	addition to all of the capabilities of the standard edition, the
	professional addition adds these great features:
</p>
<ul>
	<li>
		Open Architecture supports <b>Microsoft Access</b> and <b>Microsoft SQL Server (including the free <i>Express</i> version)</b>
		Database
	</li>
	<li>
		<a href="/ChemPoint/CPGraphs">Twelve different types of graphs</a>
	</li>
	<li>
		<a href="/ChemPoint/Contouring">Contour parameter concentrations</a> without
		leaving the program.&nbsp; Choose from three
		gridding algorithms.&nbsp; You can even contour over an aerial photograph.
	</li>
	<li>
		<b>Enhanced reporting</b> -- more powerful
		reports, export reports directly to Microsoft Excel or to HTML tables.
	</li>
	<li>
		Print sample container labels
	</li>
	<li>
		Exclude individual analyses from
		statistical analysis
	</li>
	<li>
		Track work sessions -- Shows how much time is spent
		working on each facility.
	</li>
</ul>

<p align="center">
	<br>
	*Requires Microsoft Excel to be
	installed on your computer.<br />
</p>
